category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran
sdesc: "Multidimensional B-Spline Interpolation of Data on a Regular Grid (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The library provides subroutines for 1D-6D interpolation and extrapolation
using B-splines. The code is written in modern Fortran (i.e., Fortran 2003+).
There are two ways to use the module, via a basic subroutine interface and an
object-oriented interface. Both are thread safe."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/jacobwilliams/bspline-fortran
license: BSD-3-Clause
